-- 1. Golden Triangle
UPDATE "State" SET 
  "seoTitle" = 'Golden Triangle Tours India: Delhi, Agra, Jaipur | KoiKoi',
  "seoDescription" = 'Private Golden Triangle tours connecting Delhi, Taj Mahal & Jaipur. Custom pace, verified chauffeurs & heritage stays. Get a free quote on WhatsApp.',
  "h1Title" = 'Golden Triangle Tours India',
  "overView" = '<p>Planning your first trip to India? The classic Golden Triangle connecting Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur is the most celebrated travel circuit in the country. From the bustling lanes and Mughal monuments of Old Delhi to a quiet sunrise at the Taj Mahal and the pink sandstone palaces of Jaipur, every stop tells a different chapter of Indian history.</p><p>At KoiKoi Travel, our Golden Triangle tours are 100% private and tailor-made. Travel in a comfortable air-conditioned vehicle with your dedicated verified chauffeur, explore forts and palaces with licensed local heritage guides, and enjoy handpicked boutique or heritage hotel stays without rush or forced shopping stops.</p><p>Browse our popular Golden Triangle itineraries below — or combine them with Ranthambore tiger safaris, Varanasi, or Rishikesh. Contact us directly to get a custom day-by-day itinerary and quote.</p>'
WHERE slug = 'golden-triangle';

-- 2. Rajasthan
UPDATE "State" SET 
  "seoTitle" = 'Rajasthan Tour Packages: Palaces, Forts & Desert | KoiKoi',
  "seoDescription" = 'Private tailor-made Rajasthan tour packages: Jaipur forts, Udaipur lakes, Jodhpur & Thar desert dunes. Dedicated chauffeur & 24/7 care. Get a free quote.',
  "h1Title" = 'Rajasthan Tour Packages',
  "overView" = '<p>Rajasthan is a living fairy tale of royal grandeur, grand hilltop forts, romantic lakeside palaces, and sweeping Thar desert dunes. Whether you are wandering through the blue lanes of Jodhpur, watching sunset over Lake Pichola in Udaipur, or camping under starry desert skies in Jaisalmer, every corner offers an unforgettable royal experience.</p><p>With KoiKoi Travel, you never travel on a rigid bus tour. Every Rajasthan holiday is designed exclusively for your travel style and calendar — featuring private luxury car transfers, vetted local storytellers, and stays in authentic royal havelis and heritage palaces.</p><p>Explore our curated Rajasthan holiday packages below. Tell us your dates and preferred comfort level, and our local trip designers will build a seamless route tailored just for you.</p>'
WHERE slug = 'rajasthan';

-- 3. Kerala
UPDATE "State" SET 
  "seoTitle" = 'Kerala Tour Packages: Backwaters, Munnar & Beach | KoiKoi',
  "seoDescription" = 'Handcrafted Kerala tour packages: private Alleppey houseboat cruises, misty Munnar tea hills & Kovalam beaches. Dedicated team in India. Get a free quote.',
  "h1Title" = 'Kerala Tour Packages',
  "overView" = '<p>Welcome to God''s Own Country, where emerald backwaters weave through coconut groves, misty rolling hills are blanketed with tea plantations, and gentle Arabian Sea beaches offer pure serenity. Kerala is India''s most relaxing destination, renowned for holistic Ayurveda healing, rich spice plantations, and fresh coastal cuisine.</p><p>We curate authentic private Kerala journeys with premium verified houseboats in Alleppey, handpicked eco-resorts in Munnar, and peaceful beach stays in Marari or Kovalam. With your own private chauffeur and dedicated trip coordinator, your holiday moves at your preferred pace.</p><p>Browse our recommended Kerala holiday itineraries below. Have specific dates or hotel preferences in mind? Message us on WhatsApp to receive a personalized day-by-day plan within 24 hours.</p>'
WHERE slug = 'kerala';

-- 4. South India
UPDATE "State" SET 
  "seoTitle" = 'South India Tours: Temples, Heritage & Coastline | KoiKoi',
  "seoDescription" = 'Handcrafted South India private tours: UNESCO ruins of Hampi, Dravidian temples, Mysore palaces & green hills. Custom itineraries & private chauffeur.',
  "h1Title" = 'South India Tours & Holiday Packages',
  "overView" = '<p>South India is a treasure trove of towering Dravidian temple gopurams, ancient empires, fragrant spice trails, and tranquil coastal towns. From the UNESCO World Heritage boulder ruins of Hampi and the royal palaces of Mysore to the French colonial streets of Pondicherry and sacred temple ghats of Madurai, it is a region rich in living heritage.</p><p>KoiKoi Travel designs customized private South India holidays that balance deep cultural immersion with comfortable pacing. Travel in comfort with dedicated chauffeurs across Karnataka, Tamil Nadu, and Kerala, guided by knowledgeable local specialists who bring thousands of years of art and architecture to life.</p><p>Check out our curated South India tour packages below. Tell us which regions inspire you, and we will craft a private itinerary built entirely around your vision.</p>'
WHERE slug = 'south-india';
